# Titan 2 Elite: a held Sym+A selects all once; its key repeats, also after Sym is released first,
# must not replace the selection, and A types again after a full release.
# Requires auto-capitalization of the first letter disabled.
# Needs the opt-in setting for the Sym+C/V/X/A edit shortcuts; the runner does not change settings.
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout qwerty
hw type hello
expect hello
hw hold AGUI_SYM
hw hold A
# Longer than the key repeat delay, so A repeats while Sym is down.
wait 1200
hw release AGUI_SYM
# A keeps repeating without Sym.
wait 1200
hw release A
expect hello
hw type x
expect x
hw type a
expect xa
